{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/engineering-1/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Overblog","author":"zitup"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"408b670f-500a-5aa0-a7c4-689d85bce968","html":"<blockquote>\n<p>前言</p>\n<p>现在的前端早已不是以前的 JS + CSS 一把梭的时代，它包含了广泛的内容，前端工程化是其中绕不开的基础建设。而在不同的开发阶段，工程化又包含不同的内容。</p>\n<p>开发阶段：eslint、babel<br>\n构建阶段：webpack<br>\n测试阶段：..<br>\n部署阶段：CI/CD<br>\n监控阶段：..  </p>\n<p>每一项技术包含的内容非常多，但是作为一个前端人是怎么也绕不开的，只能用力学习了。</p>\n<p>本系列聚焦于开发阶段和构建阶段，以实际的业务项目为本，力求逐篇掌握 eslint、babel、webpack 的原理和使用。系列结束时，希望可以完全掌握业务项目，并进行升级优化。</p>\n<p>本篇为 eslint。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"介绍\"><a href=\"#%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>介绍</h2>\n<p>ESLint 是识别和报告 JS 中特定模式的库，在开发中避免 bug。</p>\n<p>它有以下几个特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 Espree 解析 JS</li>\n<li>使用 AST(Abstract Syntax Tree) 评估代码中的模式</li>\n<li>可插拔，每条规则都是一个插件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"配置\"><a href=\"#%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>配置</h2>\n<p>ESLint 由配置驱动，在配置中定义需要的规则。</p>\n<p>有两种方式配置 ESLint：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>JS 注释</li>\n<li>配置文件</li>\n</ol>\n<p>配置文件是主要的方式，它包含很多选项，让我们可以细粒度的控制 ESLint 如何对待代码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"configuration-files\"><a href=\"#configuration-files\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Configuration Files</h3>\n<p>  ESLint 支持多个文件后缀：<code class=\"language-text\">js,cjs,yaml/yml,json</code>，和 <code class=\"language-text\">package.json</code> 中的 <code class=\"language-text\">eslintConfig</code> 字段。</p>\n<p>  多个配置文件存在时，优先级如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">.eslintrc.js</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">.eslintrc.cjs</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">.eslintrc.yaml</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">.eslintrc.yml</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">.eslintrc.json</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">package.json</code></li>\n<li>\n<h4 id=\"setting\"><a href=\"#setting\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>setting</h4>\n<p>共享信息可以通过此字段分享给所有插件。</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;settings&quot;: {\n      &quot;sharedData&quot;: &quot;Hello&quot;\n    }\n  }</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4 id=\"extends\"><a href=\"#extends\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>extends</h4>\n<p>继承其它配置文件的规则、插件和语言选项。</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;extends&quot;: &quot;eslint:recommended&quot;,\n  }</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4 id=\"rules\"><a href=\"#rules\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>rules</h4>\n<p>规则列表。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4 id=\"plugin\"><a href=\"#plugin\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>plugin</h4>\n<p>插件是一个 npm 包，可以为 ESLint 提供各种扩展，比如规则、配置。</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;plugins&quot;: [\n      &quot;react&quot;\n    ],\n    &quot;extends&quot;: [\n      &quot;eslint:recommended&quot;,\n      &quot;plugin:react/recommended&quot;\n    ],\n    &quot;rules&quot;: {\n      &quot;react/no-set-state&quot;: &quot;off&quot;\n    }\n  }</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3 id=\"overrides\"><a href=\"#overrides\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>overrides</h3>\n<p>可以使用 overrides 键覆盖配置中的设置，覆盖文件基于 glob 模式选择。</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;rules&quot;: {\n      &quot;quotes&quot;: [&quot;error&quot;, &quot;double&quot;]\n    },\n    &quot;overrides&quot;: [\n      {\n        &quot;files&quot;: [&quot;bin/*.js&quot;, &quot;lib/*.js&quot;],\n        &quot;excludedFiles&quot;: &quot;*.test.js&quot;,\n        &quot;rules&quot;: {\n          &quot;quotes&quot;: [&quot;error&quot;, &quot;single&quot;]\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"language-options\"><a href=\"#language-options\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Language Options</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4 id=\"env\"><a href=\"#env\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>env</h4>\n<p>制定脚本的运行环境，每种环境都有一组特定的预定义全局变量。供 ESLint 判断当前环境和可使用的全局变量。</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;env&quot;: {\n      &quot;browser&quot;: true,\n      &quot;node&quot;: true,\n      &quot;es6&quot;: true\n    }\n  }</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4 id=\"globals\"><a href=\"#globals\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>globals</h4>\n<p>自定义全局变量。也可以在这里禁止某些全局标量的使用。</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;globals&quot;: {\n      &quot;var1&quot;: &quot;writable&quot;,\n      &quot;var2&quot;: &quot;readonly&quot;\n    }\n  }</code></pre></div>\n<p>代码中可以像全局变量那样直接使用 var1/var2 ，而且 var2 只读，不可以更改。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4 id=\"parseroptions\"><a href=\"#parseroptions\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>parserOptions</h4>\n<p>定义支持的 ECMAScript 语法版本。比如 <code class=\"language-text\">{ parserOptions: { ecmaVersion: 6 } }</code>。支持的配置项如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ecmaVersion: 3, 5 (default), 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, or 13。或者 latest</li>\n<li>sourceType: script(default)/module，设置代码是否在 ESModule 下运行</li>\n<li>allowReserved</li>\n<li>\n<p>ecmaFeatures</p>\n<ul>\n<li>globalReturn</li>\n<li>impliedScript</li>\n<li>jsx</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;parserOptions&quot;: {\n      &quot;ecmaVersion&quot;: &quot;latest&quot;,\n      &quot;sourceType&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,\n      &quot;ecmaFeatures&quot;: {\n        &quot;jsx&quot;: true\n      }\n    }\n  }</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"rules-1\"><a href=\"#rules-1\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Rules</h3>\n<p>ESLint 自身携带了很多规则。也可以通过插件引入其它规则，也可以在配置中覆盖某些规则。通过以下几个值修改规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>“off” / 0 关闭规则</li>\n<li>“warn” / 1 触发时警告</li>\n<li>“error” / 2 触发式报错</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;rules&quot;: {\n      &quot;eqeqeq&quot;: &quot;off&quot;,\n      &quot;curly&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,\n      &quot;quotes&quot;: [&quot;error&quot;, &quot;double&quot;]\n    }\n  }</code></pre></div>\n<p>代码内修改规则：</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token comment\">/* eslint eqeqeq: \"off\", curly: \"error\" -- Here's a description about why this configuration is necessary. */</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>代码内禁止规则：</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token comment\">/* eslint-disable */</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'foo'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">/* eslint-enable */</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'foo'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// eslint-disable-line</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// eslint-disable-next-line</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'foo'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">/* eslint-disable-next-line */</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'foo'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'foo'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* eslint-disable-line */</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>针对性的禁用规则还可以在配置文件的 overrides 字段设置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"plugins\"><a href=\"#plugins\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Plugins</h3>\n<p>  parser</p>\n<p>  ESLint 默认使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/eslint/espree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Espree</a> 解析器。也可以使用第三方符合规范的解析器：</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsxon\"><pre class=\"language-jsxon\"><code class=\"language-jsxon\">  {\n    &quot;parser&quot;: &quot;esprima&quot;,\n    &quot;rules&quot;: {\n      &quot;semi&quot;: &quot;error&quot;\n    }\n  }</code></pre></div>\n<p>  以下是三个常用的解析器</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/esprima\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Esprima</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@babel/eslint-parser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@babel/eslint-parser</a> babel 解析器的包装，使其与 ESLint 兼容</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@typescript-eslint/parser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@typescript-eslint/parser</a> 将 TypeScript 转换为 ESTree 兼容的形式，以便 TS 可以在 ESLint 中使用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ignoring-code\"><a href=\"#ignoring-code\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Ignoring Code</h3>","timeToRead":4,"frontmatter":{"title":"ESLint","date":"December 13, 2021","spoiler":"前端工程化之 ESLint","cta":"JS"},"fields":{"slug":"/engineering-1/","langKey":"en"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/engineering-1/","previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/js-7-Object/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"js-7-Object"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Object"}},"next":null,"translations":[],"translatedLinks":[]}},"staticQueryHashes":["708209134"]}